@ToriiApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Register — crée un compte et renvoie les tokens
# @name register
POST {{ToriiApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@torii.dev",
  "password": "password123",
  "displayName": "Alice"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{ToriiApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@torii.dev",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Me — nécessite un access token (repris de la réponse login/register)
GET {{ToriiApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Refresh — échange le refresh token contre de nouveaux tokens
POST {{ToriiApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout — révoque le refresh token
POST {{ToriiApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}
